            b.  master
            c.  husband
            d.  prophet
            e.  governor
            f.  prince
            g.  king
        2.  reference to God
            a.  Lord of lords (probably = " thy husband, Yahweh" )
    c.  my lord, my master
        1.  reference to men
            a.  master
            b.  husband
            c.  prophet
            d.  prince
            e.  king
            f.  father
            g.  Moses
            h.  priest
            i.  theophanic angel
            j.  captain
            k.  general recognition of superiority
        2.  reference to God
            a.  my Lord,my Lord and my God
            b.  Adonai (parallel with Yahweh)

