    b.  as a preposition
        1.  behind, after (of place)
        2.  after (of time)
        3.  besides
    c.  as a conjunction
    d.  after that
    e.  as a substantive
        1.  hinder part
    f.  with other prepositions
        1.  from behind
        2.  from following after

