properly the constructively contracted form of an otherwise unused noun
from H995; a distinction ; but used only as a preposition, between
(repeated before each noun, often with other particles); also as a
conjugation, either ... or: - among, asunder, at, between (-twixt. ..
and), + from (the widest), X in, out of, whether (it be... or), within.`,
