cast out, consume, destroy, disinherit, dispossess, drive (-ing) out,
enjoy, expel, X without fail, (give to, leave for) inherit (-ance,
-or), + magistrate, be (make) poor, come to poverty, (give to, make to)
possess, get (have) in (take) possession, seize upon, succeed, X
utterly.`,
