    c.  of the reign of Christians in the millennium
2.  metaphorically to exercise the highest influence, to control

Origin: from G935

TDNT entry: 10:51,0

Part(s) of speech: Verb

Strong's Definition: From G935; to rule (literally or figuratively): -
