Origin: from G2596 and G4095

TDNT entry: 08:38,8

Part(s) of speech: Verb

Strong's Definition: From G2596 and G4095; to drink down, that is, gulp
entire (literally or figuratively): - devour, drown, swallow (up).`,
//==========================================================
