Origin: from a compound of G2596 and a derivative of G3717 [cf G1357]

TDNT entry: None

Part(s) of speech: Noun Neuter

Strong's Definition: From a compound of G2596 and a derivative of G3717
(compare G1357); something made fully upright, that is, (figuratively)
