//==========================================================
G2740:`Original: καῦσις

Transliteration: kausis

Phonetic: kow'-sis

Thayer Definition:

1.  burning, burning up

Origin: from G2545

TDNT entry: 13:43,4

Part(s) of speech: Noun Feminine

