Origin: from G2741

TDNT entry: 13:44,4

Part(s) of speech: Noun Masculine

Strong's Definition: From G2741; a glare: - (burning) heat.`,
//==========================================================
G2743:`Original: καυτηριάζω

Transliteration: kautēriazō

Phonetic: kow-tay-ree-ad'-zo

Thayer Definition:

1.  to mark by branding, to brand, branded with their own consciences
