3.  a tract of land, a region

Origin: from G2827

TDNT entry: None

Part(s) of speech: Noun Neuter

Strong's Definition: From G2827; a slope, that is, (specifically) a "
clime" or tract of country: - part, region.`,
//==========================================================
G2825:`Original: κλίνη

Transliteration: klinē

Phonetic: klee'-nay

Thayer Definition:

