TDNT entry: 16:17,4

Part(s) of speech: Verb

Strong's Definition: From G2844; to share with others (objectively or
subjectively): - communicate, distribute, be partaker.`,
//==========================================================
G2842:`Original: κοινωνία

Transliteration: koinōnia

Phonetic: koy-nohn-ee'-ah

Thayer Definition:

1.  fellowship, association, community, communion, joint participation,
    intercourse
