    c.  a gift jointly contributed, a collection, a contribution, as
        exhibiting an embodiment and proof of fellowship

Origin: from G2844

TDNT entry: 16:17,4

Part(s) of speech: Noun Feminine

Strong's Definition: From G2844; partnership, that is, (literally)
