    Cappadocia, Galatia and Phrygia, whose chief towns were Derbe,
    Lystra and Iconium

Origin: perhaps remotely from G3074

TDNT entry: None

Part(s) of speech: Noun Location

Strong's Definition: Perhaps remotely from G3074; Lycaonia, a region of
Asia Minor: - Lycaonia.`,
//==========================================================
G3072:`Original: Λυκαονιστί

