TDNT entry: None

Part(s) of speech: Adverb

Strong's Definition: Adverb from a derivative of G3071; Lycaonistically,
that is, in the language of the Lycaonians: - in the speech of Lycaonia.`,
//==========================================================
G3073:`Original: Λυκία

Transliteration: Lukia

Phonetic: loo-kee'-ah

