3.  to have a miserable end

Origin: of uncertain affinity

TDNT entry: None

Part(s) of speech: Verb

Strong's Definition: Of uncertain affinity; to extinguish (as fire),
that is, (figuratively and passively) to pass away: - fade away.`,
//==========================================================
G3134:`Original: μαρὰνἀθά

Transliteration: maran atha

Phonetic: mar'-an ath'-ah

Thayer Definition:

