Maran-atha.`,
//==========================================================
G3135:`Original: μαργαρίτης

Transliteration: margaritēs

Phonetic: mar-gar-ee'-tace

Thayer Definition:

1.  a pearl
2.  a proverb, i.e. a word of great value

