voluntary observation; and from G1492, which expresses merely
mechanical, passive or casual vision; while G2300, and still more
emphatically its intensive G2334, signifies an earnest but more
continued inspection ; and G4648 a watching from a distance): - appear,
look, see, shew self.`,
