G3801:`Original: ὁὢνὁἦνὁἐρχόμενος

Transliteration: ho ōn ho ēn ho erchomenos

Phonetic:

Origin: a phrase combining G3588 with the present participle and
imperfect of G1510 and the present participle of G2064 by means of G2532

TDNT entry: None

Part(s) of speech:

