TDNT entry: 15:36,8

Part(s) of speech: Noun

Strong's Definition: Perhaps from G3817; a boy (as often beaten with
impunity), or (by analogy) a girl, and (generally) a child ;
specifically a slave or servant (especially a minister to a king; and by
eminence to God): - child, maid (-en), (man) servant, son, young man.`,
//==========================================================
G3817:`Original: παίω

Transliteration: paiō

