//==========================================================
G4689:`Original: σπένδω

Transliteration: spendō

Phonetic: spen'-do

Thayer Definition:

1.  to pour out as a drink offering, make a libation
2.  in the NT to be offered as a libation
3.  fig. used of one whose blood is poured out in a violent death for
    the cause of God

Origin: apparently a primary verb

TDNT entry: 7:528,*

Part(s) of speech: Verb

Strong's Definition: Apparently a primary verb; to pour out as a
