Phonetic: troo-fah'-o

Thayer Definition:

1.  to live delicately, live luxuriously, be given to soft and luxurious
    life

Origin: from G5172

TDNT entry: None

Part(s) of speech: Verb

Strong's Definition: From G5172; to indulge in luxury: - live in
pleasure.`,
//==========================================================
G5172:`Original: τρυφή

Transliteration: truphē

Phonetic: troo-fay'

Thayer Definition:

