Origin: from G5172

TDNT entry: None

Part(s) of speech: Noun Feminine

Strong's Definition: From G5172; luxuriating ; Tryphosa, a Christian
female: - Tryphosa.`,
//==========================================================
G5174:`Original: Τρωάς

Transliteration: Trōas

Phonetic: tro-as'

Thayer Definition: Troas = "a Trojan"

