2.  to show by words and arguments, i.e. to teach
3.  to show by make known future things

Origin: from G5259 and G1166

TDNT entry: None

Part(s) of speech: Verb

Strong's Definition: From G5259 and G1166; to exhibit under the eyes,
(figuratively) to exemplify (instruct, admonish): - show, (fore-) warn.`,
//==========================================================
G5264:`Original: ὑποδέχομαι

Transliteration: hupodechomai

Phonetic: hoop-od-ekh'-om-ahee

